  "description": "A console application that helps you manage and update NuGet packages in .NET projects using Central Package Management (Directory.Packages.props). Supports conditional packages with framework-specific conditions,\n            GlobalPackageReference items for analyzers and tools, and provides intelligent framework-aware version updates. Uses the same credential providers as 'dotnet restore' for seamless authentication with private feeds.",
